  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Power Sector Reforms and Financial Sustainability Program (Subprogram 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The principal objective of the Programmatic Approach is to establish the independence and financial sustainability of electricity utilities and streamline and accelerate the development of renewable energy sources. The Programmatic Approach comprises three subprograms and the Program is the second subprogram. The Program scope includes reforms to (i) the institutional structure of the power sector; (ii) the tariff structure with a view to making tariffs cost reflective; and (iii) renewable energy development and related procurement processes. The Program is described in more detail in the Policy Letter and the PDF.</narrative>
  </description>
